ê α«»α«╛α««α»ì α«òα«úα»ìα«ƒα»çα««α»ì; α«àα«╡α«│α»ì α«¿α«┐α«⌐α»ìα«⌐α»ïα«ƒα»ü α«¿α»Çα«ƒα»éα«┤α«┐ α«╡α«╛α«┤α»ìα«╡α«╛α«│α«╛α«ò;",
    "english":  "The white gulls roost in noisy flocks among the fragrant punnai boughs,\nas the evening shadows stretch across the tranquil shore.\nThe sea roars its ancient song against the sand dunes,\nand the lights from the fishermen\u0027s huts flicker like evening stars.\nMy beloved, whose land is cooled by the salt sea spray,\nhas left me to battle alone against the rising tide of loneliness.\nThe chill dusk brings only an ache to my heart and tears to my eyes;\neven the wind that blew his chariot away\nnow mocks my sorrow with its relentless sighing.",
